<title>UK: TABLE TENNIS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of the final day of the world table tennis championships on Monday (prefix numbers denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles final</p>
<p>1-Jan-Ove Waldner (Sweden) beat 3/4-Vladimir Samsonov (Belarus) 21-12 21-17 21-13</p>
<p>Women's singles final</p>
<p>1-Deng Yaping (China) beat 5/8-Wang Nan (China) 12-21 21-8 21-11 21-10</p>
<p>Women's doubles semifinals</p>
<p>1-Deng Yaping/Yang Ying (China) beat 3/4-Qiao Yunping (China)/ Chai Po Wa (Hong Kong) 21-8 21-7 21-12</p>
<p>3/4-Li Ju/Wang Nan (China) beat 5/8-Wang Hui/Cheng Hongxia (China) 21-10 21-17 21-16</p>
<p>Women's doubles final</p>
<p>1-Deng/Yang beat Li/Wang 21-17 22-20 17-21 19-21 21-11</p>
<p>Men's doubles semifinals</p>
<p>2-Jan-Ove Waldner/Jorgen Persson (Sweden) beat 5/8-Koji Matsushita/Hiroshi Shibutani (Japan) 21-19 13-21 21-18 18-21 21-18</p>
<p>1-Kong Linghui/Liu Guoliang (China) beat 5/8-Jean-Philippe Gatien/Damien Eloi (France) 22-20 21-7 21-9</p>
<p>Men's doubles final</p>
<p>1-Kong/Liu beat Waldner/Persson 19-21 21-15 18-21 21-13 21-17.</p>
</text>
